{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"continuity_clean_injury_001","task":"continuity_detection","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"伤势正常承接","instructions":"判断后一章是否与前章伤势和行动连续。","context":"前章末：凌晨受伤后，凌默用纱布包好左手，天亮后直接去学校。","candidate_text":"早读前，同桌问他手上的纱布。凌默把书包放下，只说昨晚碰伤了，掌心的灼痛仍没有消失。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0001-P001","text":"凌晨受伤后，凌默用纱布包好左手，天亮后直接去学校。","location":"前章末"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":["boundary.temporal","state.injury_reset","character.knowledge"],"state_facet_vocabulary":[],"criteria":{},"expected_decision":"clean","gold_issues":[],"gold_state_facets":[],"gold_criteria":[],"tags":["clean","injury"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"continuity_temporal_002","task":"continuity_detection","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"不足三小时写成整夜","instructions":"判断时间长度是否能由前文支持。","context":"前章：凌晨四点后的冲突造成左手灼伤；六点四十五分时凌默仍未入睡，正准备上学。","candidate_text":"虽然体内的力量已经替他修复了一整夜，但左手皮肉依旧狰狞。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0001-P004","text":"凌晨四点后的冲突造成左手灼伤。","location":"前章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0001-P009","text":"六点四十五分时凌默仍未入睡，正准备上学。","location":"前章末"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":["boundary.temporal","state.injury_reset","character.knowledge"],"state_facet_vocabulary":[],"criteria":{},"expected_decision":"defect","gold_issues":[{"code":"boundary.temporal","severity":"blocking"}],"gold_state_facets":[],"gold_criteria":[],"tags":["controlled_mutation","temporal"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"continuity_knowledge_003","task":"continuity_detection","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"缺失的前次见面","instructions":"判断人物是否拥有前文未建立的知识或经历。","context":"前章只描写一段口诀直接进入意识，没有出现传承者的人影，也没有人物对话。","candidate_text":"那道模糊的人影从书架深处浮现，比上次更加透明。凌默立即认出，这就是昨夜给他传承的老者。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0001-P003","text":"一段口诀直接进入意识，没有出现传承者的人影，也没有人物对话。","location":"前章"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":["boundary.temporal","state.injury_reset","character.knowledge"],"state_facet_vocabulary":[],"criteria":{},"expected_decision":"defect","gold_issues":[{"code":"character.knowledge","severity":"blocking"}],"gold_state_facets":[],"gold_criteria":[],"tags":["controlled_mutation","knowledge_boundary"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"state_coverage_004","task":"state_delta_coverage","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"伤势、睡眠债与异常清醒","instructions":"只提取会延续到下一章的状态维度，不复述瞬时动作。","context":"当前状态中尚未记录本章变化。","candidate_text":"凌默整夜没有合眼，左手灼伤被纱布紧紧包住。奇怪的是，他直到走进教室仍没有半点困意，只在错题本上记下：这种清醒也许不是好事。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0001-P001","text":"凌默整夜没有合眼，左手灼伤被纱布紧紧包住。奇怪的是，他直到走进教室仍没有半点困意，只在错题本上记下：这种清醒也许不是好事。","location":"本章"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":[],"state_facet_vocabulary":["injury","sleep_debt","abnormal_alertness","location","inventory","relationship_change"],"criteria":{},"expected_decision":"complete","gold_issues":[],"gold_state_facets":["injury","sleep_debt","abnormal_alertness"],"gold_criteria":[],"tags":["state_delta","omission_risk","location_is_scene_not_state"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"unit_complete_005","task":"unit_completion","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"身体异常确认单元已完成","instructions":"逐项判断作者验收条件是否在正文中真实兑现。","context":"单元目标：凌默确认异常与图书馆传承相关，同时不向同学暴露传承。","candidate_text":"第一章，凌默连续三天记录发作时间，并发现只有从旧图书馆回来后红纹才会升温。第二章，他在阅览室外做了一次对照：没有进馆时红纹沉寂，跨过门槛后立即发热。他把结果写进错题本，对同桌仍只解释为普通烫伤。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:UNIT-P001","text":"凌默连续三天记录发作时间，并发现只有从旧图书馆回来后红纹才会升温。","location":"第一章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:UNIT-P002","text":"没有进馆时红纹沉寂，跨过门槛后立即发热。","location":"第二章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:UNIT-P003","text":"对同桌仍只解释为普通烫伤。","location":"第二章"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":[],"state_facet_vocabulary":[],"criteria":{"C1":"用可重复对照确认异常与图书馆相关","C2":"凌默把结论记录下来","C3":"没有向同学暴露传承"},"expected_decision":"complete","gold_issues":[],"gold_state_facets":[],"gold_criteria":[{"criterion_id":"C1","status":"met"},{"criterion_id":"C2","status":"met"},{"criterion_id":"C3","status":"met"}],"tags":["unit_completion","complete"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"unit_incomplete_006","task":"unit_completion","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"只有猜测没有对照","instructions":"逐项判断作者验收条件是否真正兑现，不接受叙述者替人物宣布结论。","context":"单元目标：凌默通过可重复对照确认异常与图书馆传承相关，同时不向同学暴露传承。","candidate_text":"凌默从图书馆出来时红纹又热了一次。他觉得这多半和那栋楼有关，于是把猜测写进错题本。第二天同桌追问，他含糊地说自己也不知道。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:UNIT-P001","text":"凌默从图书馆出来时红纹又热了一次。","location":"第一章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:UNIT-P002","text":"他觉得这多半和那栋楼有关，于是把猜测写进错题本。","location":"第一章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:UNIT-P003","text":"同桌追问，他含糊地说自己也不知道。","location":"第二章"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":[],"state_facet_vocabulary":[],"criteria":{"C1":"用可重复对照确认异常与图书馆相关","C2":"凌默把结论记录下来","C3":"没有向同学暴露传承"},"expected_decision":"incomplete","gold_issues":[],"gold_state_facets":[],"gold_criteria":[{"criterion_id":"C1","status":"unmet"},{"criterion_id":"C2","status":"partial"},{"criterion_id":"C3","status":"met"}],"tags":["unit_completion","incomplete","causal_evidence"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"state_no_new_inventory_007","task":"state_delta_coverage","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"旧物被提及但未变化","instructions":"只提取本章新产生或改变且会延续的状态。","context":"凌默从开学起一直使用同一本错题本；进入教室是日常行动。","candidate_text":"凌默走进教室，把开学以来一直使用的错题本放回书包。第一节课前，他又拿出来补完了昨天的数学题。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0004-P001","text":"凌默走进教室，把开学以来一直使用的错题本放回书包。第一节课前，他又拿出来补完了昨天的数学题。","location":"本章"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":[],"state_facet_vocabulary":["inventory","location","study_progress"],"criteria":{},"expected_decision":"complete","gold_issues":[],"gold_state_facets":[],"gold_criteria":[],"tags":["state_delta","negative_control","mention_not_change"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"state_resource_consumption_008","task":"state_delta_coverage","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"资源耗尽和伤势必须同时记录","instructions":"提取会影响下一章的全部持久变化。","context":"战斗前凌默只剩一张雷符，左臂没有伤。","candidate_text":"凌默撕碎最后一张雷符逼退女鬼，左臂却被鬼爪划开一道深口。逃出仓库后，他用校服袖口压住仍在流血的伤口。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0010-P001","text":"凌默撕碎最后一张雷符逼退女鬼，左臂却被鬼爪划开一道深口。","location":"本章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0010-P002","text":"逃出仓库后，他用校服袖口压住仍在流血的伤口。","location":"本章"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":[],"state_facet_vocabulary":["resource_depletion","injury","location","relationship_change"],"criteria":{},"expected_decision":"complete","gold_issues":[],"gold_state_facets":["resource_depletion","injury"],"gold_criteria":[],"tags":["state_delta","multi_facet","cost"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"state_knowledge_decision_009","task":"state_delta_coverage","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"新知识与隐瞒决定","instructions":"提取人物知识和会延续的决定，不复述读消息这一瞬时动作。","context":"凌默此前不知道赵灵瑶已经离开学校，也没有决定对秦思妍隐瞒。","candidate_text":"短信只有两行：赵灵瑶昨夜已离开学校，三天内不会回来。凌默看完删掉消息，决定暂时不把这件事告诉秦思妍。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0012-P001","text":"短信只有两行：赵灵瑶昨夜已离开学校，三天内不会回来。","location":"本章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0012-P002","text":"凌默看完删掉消息，决定暂时不把这件事告诉秦思妍。","location":"本章"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":[],"state_facet_vocabulary":["character_knowledge","secrecy_decision","inventory","location"],"criteria":{},"expected_decision":"complete","gold_issues":[],"gold_state_facets":["character_knowledge","secrecy_decision"],"gold_criteria":[],"tags":["state_delta","knowledge_boundary","decision"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"unit_partial_conclusion_010","task":"unit_completion","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"重复现象仍未形成因果结论","instructions":"严格区分现象重复、可控对照和因果确认。","context":"作者要求通过可重复的受控对照确认红纹由图书馆门槛触发，并把结论记录下来。","candidate_text":"凌默两次从旧图书馆出来时红纹都发热，但第三次站在门外也突然热了一下。他在错题本上写道：暂时怀疑与图书馆有关，还需要排除时间因素。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:UNIT-P010","text":"凌默两次从旧图书馆出来时红纹都发热，但第三次站在门外也突然热了一下。","location":"第一至二章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:UNIT-P011","text":"暂时怀疑与图书馆有关，还需要排除时间因素。","location":"第二章"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":[],"state_facet_vocabulary":[],"criteria":{"C1":"通过可重复的受控对照确认红纹由图书馆门槛触发","C2":"把确认后的结论记录下来"},"expected_decision":"incomplete","gold_issues":[],"gold_state_facets":[],"gold_criteria":[{"criterion_id":"C1","status":"unmet"},{"criterion_id":"C2","status":"unmet"}],"tags":["unit_completion","unmet","causal_strength","label_corrected_after_rationale_audit"]}
{"schema_version":"novel-benchmark-case/v2","case_id":"continuity_explained_time_011","task":"continuity_detection","source_tier":"synthetic_controlled","title":"明确时间解释不得误报","instructions":"检查章际时间和伤势连续性；已有明确解释时不要误报。","context":"前章末：凌晨四点战斗结束。凌默一直清醒到六点四十五分，只短暂闭眼休息了十分钟。","candidate_text":"七点，他重新缠紧纱布。丹田里的热流只修复了不到三个小时，左手依然疼得厉害。","evidence_catalog":[{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0001-P020","text":"凌晨四点战斗结束。","location":"前章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0001-P021","text":"凌默一直清醒到六点四十五分，只短暂闭眼休息了十分钟。","location":"前章"},{"evidence_id":"SYN:CH0002-P001","text":"丹田里的热流只修复了不到三个小时，左手依然疼得厉害。","location":"本章"}],"issue_code_vocabulary":["boundary.temporal","state.injury_reset","character.knowledge"],"state_facet_vocabulary":[],"criteria":{},"expected_decision":"clean","gold_issues":[],"gold_state_facets":[],"gold_criteria":[],"tags":["continuity","negative_control","explained_transition"]}
